{
  "id": null,
  "uid": "ferry-models",
  "title": "Ferry — Models",
  "tags": ["llm-ferry", "models", "litellm"],
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "editable": true,
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "liveNow": false,
  "weekStart": "",
  "fiscalYearStartMonth": 0,
  "timezone": "browser",
  "refresh": "30s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "timepicker": {},
  "links": [],
  "templating": { "list": [] },
  "annotations": { "list": [] },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 100,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 0, "w": 24, "h": 3 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "## Ferry — Models\nPer-model usage for the **llm-ferry** relay: request volume, tokens, spend, latency, and success/failure — broken out by the **actual backend model** that served the call (`model`, e.g. `glm-5.3` / `gemini-3.7-flash` / `gpt-5.6-sol`), not the alias the client asked for (`requested_model`, e.g. `orchestrator`).\n\n**Source: litellm's own `/metrics`** (`litellm_*`), scraped from `127.0.0.1:8090` by VictoriaMetrics — **the prometheus callback is on by default now**, so these panels populate within one 15s scrape of the first request. If a panel reads *No data*, either no traffic has hit that model in the selected range, or `callbacks: [\"prometheus\"]` was removed from `~/.config/ferry/litellm.yaml` (see `observ/README.md`). High-cardinality labels (`model_id`, `user_agent`, `end_user`) are aggregated away on purpose."
      },
      "transparent": true
    },
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Requests/sec by model",
      "description": "sum by (model)(rate(litellm_requests_metric_total[$__rate_interval])) — throughput per backend model actually serving traffic.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 3, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 3,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "auto",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "hideFrom": { "tooltip": false, "viz": false, "legend": false },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "#2a78d6", "value": null }]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(litellm_requests_metric_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}}",
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Total requests by model (selected range)",
      "description": "sum by (model)(increase(litellm_requests_metric_total[$__range])) — total calls each backend model served over the dashboard time range.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 3, "w": 12, "h": 8 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "decimals": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "#2a78d6", "value": null }]
          },
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" },
            "filterable": true,
            "inspect": false
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Requests" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "gauge", "mode": "gradient" } },
              { "id": "custom.width", "value": 260 }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": { "show": true, "reducer": ["sum"], "countRows": false, "fields": "" }
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "__name__": true, "instance": true, "job": true },
            "indexByName": { "model": 0, "Value": 1 },
            "renameByName": { "model": "Model", "Value": "Requests" }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": { "fields": {}, "sort": [{ "field": "Requests", "desc": true }] }
        }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (increase(litellm_requests_metric_total[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Tokens/sec by model",
      "description": "sum by (model)(rate(litellm_*_tokens_metric_total[$__rate_interval])) — total / input / output / reasoning token throughput per backend model. Reasoning tokens only appear for models that emit them.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 11, "w": 16, "h": 9 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "short",
          "min": 0,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 8,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisLabel": "tokens/s",
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "hideFrom": { "tooltip": false, "viz": false, "legend": false },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "#1baf7a", "value": null }]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".* · total$" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.lineWidth", "value": 3 }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".* · (input|output|reasoning)$" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.lineWidth", "value": 1 },
              { "id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 0 }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".* · reasoning$" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [10, 10] } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "right", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(litellm_total_tokens_metric_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} · total",
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(litellm_input_tokens_metric_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} · input",
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "C",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(litellm_output_tokens_metric_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} · output",
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "D",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (rate(litellm_output_reasoning_tokens_metric_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} · reasoning",
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "table",
      "title": "Spend by model (selected range)",
      "description": "sum by (model)(increase(litellm_spend_metric_total[$__range])) — USD attributed to each backend model over the dashboard time range. $0.00 for free-tier keys.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 16, "y": 11, "w": 8, "h": 9 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "currencyUSD",
          "decimals": 4,
          "color": { "mode": "thresholds" },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "#0ca30c", "value": null }]
          },
          "custom": {
            "align": "auto",
            "cellOptions": { "type": "auto" },
            "filterable": true,
            "inspect": false
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "Spend" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.cellOptions", "value": { "type": "color-text" } },
              {
                "id": "thresholds",
                "value": {
                  "mode": "absolute",
                  "steps": [
                    { "color": "#0ca30c", "value": null },
                    { "color": "#fab219", "value": 0.5 },
                    { "color": "#d03b3b", "value": 5 }
                  ]
                }
              }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "showHeader": true,
        "cellHeight": "sm",
        "footer": { "show": true, "reducer": ["sum"], "countRows": false, "fields": "" }
      },
      "transformations": [
        {
          "id": "organize",
          "options": {
            "excludeByName": { "Time": true, "__name__": true, "instance": true, "job": true },
            "indexByName": { "model": 0, "Value": 1 },
            "renameByName": { "model": "Model", "Value": "Spend" }
          }
        },
        {
          "id": "sortBy",
          "options": { "fields": {}, "sort": [{ "field": "Spend", "desc": true }] }
        }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
          "expr": "sum by (model) (increase(litellm_spend_metric_total[$__range]))",
          "legendFormat": "",
          "instant": true,
          "format": "table"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Request latency p50/p95 by model",
      "description": "histogram_quantile(0.50|0.95, sum by (le, model)(rate(litellm_request_total_latency_metric_bucket[$__rate_interval]))) — end-to-end request latency per backend model. p95 is drawn dashed.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 0, "y": 20, "w": 12, "h": 9 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "min": 0,
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 0,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "hideFrom": { "tooltip": false, "viz": false, "legend": false },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "#2a78d6", "value": null }]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".* · p95$" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "dash", "dash": [10, 10] } },
              { "id": "custom.lineWidth", "value": 2 }
            ]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byRegexp", "options": ".* · p50$" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "custom.lineStyle", "value": { "fill": "solid" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.50, sum by (le, model) (rate(litellm_request_total_latency_metric_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} · p50",
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le, model) (rate(litellm_request_total_latency_metric_bucket[$__rate_interval])))",
          "legendFormat": "{{model}} · p95",
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "Success vs failure rate by model",
      "description": "sum by (litellm_model_name)(rate(litellm_deployment_success_responses_total[$__rate_interval])) vs the matching failure counter. Note the label here is litellm_model_name (the deployment's routed alias), not model. Success is green, failure red — any red line at all means that deployment is erroring.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
      "gridPos": { "x": 12, "y": 20, "w": 12, "h": 9 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 3,
          "color": { "mode": "palette-classic" },
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "line",
            "lineInterpolation": "smooth",
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 12,
            "gradientMode": "none",
            "spanNulls": false,
            "showPoints": "never",
            "pointSize": 5,
            "stacking": { "mode": "none", "group": "A" },
            "axisPlacement": "auto",
            "axisLabel": "",
            "scaleDistribution": { "type": "linear" },
            "hideFrom": { "tooltip": false, "viz": false, "legend": false },
            "thresholdsStyle": { "mode": "off" }
          },
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [{ "color": "#0ca30c", "value": null }]
          },
          "mappings": []
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "A" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#0ca30c" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byFrameRefID", "options": "B" },
            "properties": [
              { "id": "color", "value": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "#d03b3b" } },
              { "id": "custom.fillOpacity", "value": 25 }
            ]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "showLegend": true, "calcs": ["lastNotNull", "max"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi", "sort": "desc" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
          "expr": "sum by (litellm_model_name) (rate(litellm_deployment_success_responses_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{litellm_model_name}} · success",
          "instant": false
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "ferry-vm" },
          "expr": "sum by (litellm_model_name) (rate(litellm_deployment_failure_responses_total[$__rate_interval]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{litellm_model_name}} · failure",
          "instant": false
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
